== Local technical materials inspected August 20, 2026

*VERIFIED (local inspection).* The appendix gives the basis of each claim; this
note gives their provenance. The guarded-commitment and candidate-result
descriptions derive from separately scoped formal models reviewed by the
submitter, including a frozen Breadstuffs prototype and current Minidregg and
Leanuweave research. The worked market's accounting and shaped-payout
descriptions derive from exact pure-Rust categorical and degree-one through
degree-three B-spline kernels, separate Lean proof modules (212 theorems, zero
sorry, zero project axioms), one narrow Verus-checked transfer seam, focused
local-Agave/SBF campaigns, and the August 20, 2026 signed loopback-validator
walk of the general clearing lifecycle, run against the sealed build (manifest
gates 100/100 executed; independent portable attestation 44/44). The bounded
Clear energy-dispatch relation, the encrypted candidate-validation experiment,
and the manipulation-cost experiment are deterministic research artifacts in
separately provenanced repositories, using no market data. All are tested
subsets, not a complete venue or whole-system verification. *STOP:* no
production provider authenticator, parser, or deployable source pipeline
exists, and authenticated production price history is not a current SBF
property; permissionless source construction executes only in a deliberately
non-production mock-provider ELF, and the default ELF registers no provider or
parser release and fails closed before source state or value admission. A
public literate reference describing the worked market and its evidence
discipline is published at
#link("https://emberian.github.io/dragons-clutch/")[emberian.github.io/dragons-clutch].
A final public edition should cite frozen repository commits and exact paths
if those materials are public by filing time. No source code is included.

